    "en": "9th. JULY, 2002 No. S 38\n\nBRUNEI NATIONAL PETROLEUM COMPANY\n\nSENDIRIAN BERHAD ORDER, 2002 (S 6/2002) Notice on the granting of mineral rights by His Majesty the Sultan and Yang Di-Pertuan in Council (section 3(1)) It is hereby notified that His Majesty the Sultan and Yang Di-Pertuan in Council has on 23rd. day of April, 2002 pursuant to subsection ( 1) of section 3 of the Brunei National Petroleum Company Sendirian Berhad Order, 2002, granted all mineral rights to the Brunei National Petroleum Company Sendirian Berhad within the designated area referred to as Block J having the following coordinates -\n\nPOINT EASTING NORTHING POINT EASTING NORTHING TRPU01 490,000.000 605,000.000 J07 440,000.000 690,000.000 TR16 490,000.000 606,000.000 J08 435,000.000 690,000.000 TR15 491,000.000 606,000.000 J09 435,000.000 685,000.000 TR14 491,000.000 607,000.000 JlO 430,000.000 685,000.000 TR13 492,000.000 607,000.000 Jll 430,000.000 680,000.000 TR12 492,000.000 608,000.000 J12 425,000.000 680,000.000 TRll 493,000.000 608,000.000 J13 425,000.000 675,000.000 • TR10 493,000.000 610,000.000 J14 4201000 • 000 675,000.000 TR09 497,000.000 614,000.000 J15 420,000.000 670,000.000 TR08 497,000.000 618,000.000 J16 412,000.000 670,000.000 • TR07 500,000.000 621,000.000 JK01 412,000.000 665,000.000 TR06 500 I 000.000 624,000.000 JK02 417,000.000 665,000.000 TR05 515,391.553 639,407.067 JK03 417,000.000 6601000 • 000 J01 452,109.202 704,997.441 JK04 422,000.000 660,000.000 J02 450,000.000 705,000.000 JK05 422,000.000 00.000 J03 450,000.000 700,000.000 JK06 427,000.000 655,000.000 J04 445,000.000 700,000.000 JK07 427,000.000 650,000.000 J05 445,000.000 695,000.000 JK08 432,000.000 650,000.000\n\nBRUNEI DARUSSALAM GOVERNMENT GAZETTE • POINT EASTING NORTHING JK10 437,000.000 645,000.000 JKll 437,000.000 640,000.000 JK12 442,000.000 640,000.000 JK13 442,000. .000 JK14 447,000.000 635,000.000 JK15 447,000.000 630,000.000 JK16 452,000.000 630,000.000 JK17 452,000.000 625,000.000 JK18